  "description": "<p>This custom anchor doormat adds a personalized nautical touch to any marine setting. Designed for boat owners, it features vibrant maritime colors and anchor designs, making it a unique welcome mat for cabins, ships, and docks. Crafted for both comfort and durability, it enhances the aesthetic of any waterside area.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a unique anchor design with vibrant maritime colors.</li>\n<li>Personalize with boat name, family name, or location.</li>\n<li>Soft memory sponge material provides comfort underfoot.</li>\n<li>Equipped with anti-slip pads for secure placement.</li>\n<li>Suitable for high-traffic boat decks, marina entries, and coastal homes.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Anchor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester, Memory Sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Shake outdoors, vacuum, or wipe clean with a damp cloth; Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is perfect for use in cabins, ships, yachts, fishing boats, and dockside areas. It is suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings, adding a distinctive nautical flair to any entrance or living space.</p>",
